<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body { background: #f8fafc; font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #0f172a; margin: 0; padding: 0; } .container { max-width: 420px;
      margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.05);
      padding: 32px 24px; } h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 16px; color: #0f172a; letter-spacing: -0.5px; } p {
      font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 18px; color: #334155; } .info {
      background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px; margin: 24px 0; } .info-row { margin-bottom: 12px; } .label
      { font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a; } .footer { margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: 0.95rem; color: #64748b; text-align: center; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <h2>🎉 New User Registered</h2>

      <p>Hello Erand,</p>

      <p>A new user has just created an account on FairShare.</p>

      <div class='info'>
        <div class='info-row'>
          <span class='label'>Name:</span>
          {{name}}
        </div>

        <div class='info-row'>
          <span class='label'>Email:</span>
          {{email}}
        </div>

        <div class='info-row'>
          <span class='label'>Registered At:</span>
          {{registeredAt}}
        </div>

        <div class='info-row'>
          <span class='label'>Provider:</span>
          {{provider}}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        You are receiving this email because admin notifications are enabled for
        new user registrations.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>